661 0 obj
  << /ActualText (EXPERIENCE\n\nFlex Artificial Intelligence\t\t \t\t\t\t\t\240 \240 \240 \240 \240                                                                                      Jan 2024 \023 Present\nSenior Android Engineer\t \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\240                                                                                                                       Ottawa\054 ON\nLead engineer building Flex Fitness for Android\054 a workout companion \046 social media app\056\nI\031m responsible for app architecture\054 agile planning and estimation\054 team management\054 and dev ops\056\nOur app is built with Kotlin\054 Jetpack Compose\054 and Firebase\056\nEnforce usage of modern technologies like Flow\054 Coroutines\054 MVVM\054 and Clean Architecture\056\n\nKonrad Group\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\240 \240 \240 \240 \240 \240 \240 \240 \240                                                                                              May 2023 \023 Jan 2024\nSenior Software Developer\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \240 \240 \240 \240 \240 \240 \240 \240 \240 \240 \240                                                                                                 Toronto\054 ON\nPod lead \046 developer working on an American financial services app with 14 million users\056\nFront\055End Kotlin developer\054 contributing to Android platform\056\nFixed critical bugs in the registration flow\054 improving sign\055up conversion rate by 5\045\056\nPlayed an active role in candidate evaluation by conducting technical interviews\056\n\nKonrad Group\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\240 \240 \240 \240 \240 \240 \240 \240 \240                                                                                             Sep 2018 \023 May 2023\nSoftware Developer\t\240 \240 \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\240 \240 \240 \240 \240 \240 \240 \240 \240 \240 \240 \240 \240 \240 \240 \240 \240                                                                                              Toronto\054 ON\nKotlin and Java developer and consultant for industry leading Android apps\054 including\072\nA \034click and collect\035 grocery pickup app with over 1 million users in Canada\056\nAn at home streaming platform for a popular American fitness brand\056\n\n\nPROJECTS\n\nIris \055 Color Palette for Android \055 g)
     /K [ 7 ]
     /P 664 0 R
     /Pg 654 0 R
