  << /ActualText (\t\240\nColor picker app for designers\056 Capture\054 save\054 and analyze colors from your screen\054 or the world around you\056 Written for Android using Java\054 XML\054\240 Dagger\056\n\n\nSKILLS\n\nLanguages\072 Kotlin\054 Javascript\054 Java\054 HTML\054 CSS\054 C\053\053\054 C\nFrameworks\072 Android\054 Jetpack Compose\054 React Native\054 Flutter\054 React\nTools\072 Git\054 Github\054 Gitlab\054 Firebase\054 Jira\054 Figma\nSkills\072 Leadership\054 Teaching\054 Communication\054 Technical Presentations\054 Machine Learning\n\n\nEDUCATION\n\nUniversity of Toronto \055 BASc\054 Computer Engineering\nMinor Certificate \055 Engineering Business and Management\nTeam member \055 Varsity Swim Team \050National Champions 2015 \055 2016\051\nFluent in French)
